General tip (for non-source-divers): when you search for messages try
avoiding the pronoun and sometimes the verb if it's a common one (hear,
feel, can't) as the code treats them specially in most (but not all)
cases. A google query like

nethack "chugging sound"

should return any existing spoiler and, if there's none, a source file
or two you can peek in. It's usually fairly easy to tell why such an
event occurs, without understanding most of the surrounding code.

